      ],
      "text": "The tool ships as a single static binary with no runtime dependencies, and can be installed via Node package managers (Node >=18), cargo from crates.io, pre-built GitHub release binaries with sha256 checksum verification, or built from source requiring Rust 1.89+ and Node.js 22.22.0+."
