      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: a Catalog E2E GitHub Actions workflow validates that every skill entry can be resolved, installed, and registered; it runs manually and weekly (Mondays 08:00 UTC), and locally via RUN_E2E=1 cargo test with an agents-skills sibling checkout, kept out of normal CI because it depends on external networks."
